return ['x-generator'=>'GlotPress/4.0.1','translation-revision-date'=>'2025-04-04 08:59:37+0000','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','project-id-version'=>'Plugins - hCaptcha for WP - Stable (latest release)','language'=>'zh_TW','messages'=>['Site config is valid. Save your changes.'=>'有效的網站組態。請儲存設定。','For more information about hCaptcha’s privacy policy and terms of use, please visit the following links: %1$s and %2$s.'=>'如需進一步了解 hCaptcha 的隱私權及使用條款的相關資訊，請造訪所列連結: %1$s 及 %2$s。','IMI acts as a "data processor" acting on behalf of its customers as defined under the GDPR, and a "service provider" for the purposes of the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA).'=>'依據 GDPR 的定義，IMI 是代表其客戶處理資料的資料處理單位；依據《加州消費者隱私法》(California Consumer Privacy Act，簡稱 CCPA)，IMI 則是服務提供單位。','and other forms of abuse that can harm our service or other users of our service.'=>'這些濫用行為可能會損害我們的服務或使用我們服務的使用者。','In addition, processing may also be based on Art. 6(1)(f) of the GDPR: our online service has a legitimate interest in protecting the service from abusive automated crawling, spam,'=>'除此之外，也會依照 GDPR 的 6(1)(f) 條處理: 我們的線上服務擁有免受濫用惡意檢索、垃圾訊息侵擾的合法權益，','and that activities performed by the user are not related to fraud or abuse.'=>'且使用者執行的活動與詐騙或濫用無關。','Our online service (including our website, mobile apps, and any other apps or other forms of access offered by us) needs to ensure that it is interacting with a human, not a bot,'=>'我們的線上服務 (包含這個網站、行動裝置 App，及我們提供的其他 App 或任何方式的存取) 需要確保是與真人互動，而非漫遊器，','or in order to take steps at the request of the website visitor prior to entering into a contract.'=>'或為了在簽訂合約之前根據網站訪客的要求採取措施有其必要。','Data processing is based on Art. 6(1)(b) of the GDPR: the processing of personal data is necessary for the performance of a contract to which the website visitor is party (for example, the website terms)'=>'資料的處理遵循 GDPR 的 6(1)(b) 條: 處理個人資料對於作為一方當事人的網站訪客履約 (例如網站條款)','Website or app visitors are not advised that such an analysis is taking place if the user is not shown a challenge.'=>'如果不為訪客顯示人機驗證，便無法告知網站或行動裝置 App 訪客正在進行這類分析。','hCaptcha analysis in the "invisible mode" may take place completely in the background.'=>'使用 hCaptcha 的隱形模式，便會完全在背景中進行分析。','The data collected during the analysis will be forwarded to IMI.'=>'分析過程中所收集的資料會傳送至 IMI。','For the analysis, hCaptcha evaluates various information (e.g. IP address, how long the visitor has been on the website or app, or mouse movements made by the user).'=>'hCaptcha 會評估各種資訊以進行分析，例如 IP 位址、訪客在網站或行動裝置 App 中的停留時間，或由使用者操作的滑鼠移動。','This analysis starts automatically as soon as the website or mobile app visitor enters a part of the website or app with hCaptcha enabled.'=>'只要網站或行動裝置 App 訪客進入啟用了 hCaptcha 的網站或行動裝置 App 區域，這項分析便會自動開始。','To do this, hCaptcha analyzes the behavior of the website or mobile app visitor based on various characteristics.'=>'為了執行這些檢查，hCaptcha 會依據各種特性分析網站或行動裝置 App 訪客的行為。','hCaptcha is used to check whether user actions on our online service (such as submitting a login or contact form) meet our security requirements.'=>'hCaptcha 用於檢查使用者在使用我們的線上服務 (例如送出登入要求或傳送聯絡表單) 時，是否符合我們的安全性要求。','This service is provided by Intuition Machines, Inc., a Delaware US Corporation ("IMI").'=>'這項服務由美國德拉瓦州公司 Intuition Machines, Inc. (簡稱 IMI) 提供。','We use the hCaptcha security service (hereinafter "hCaptcha") on our website.'=>'這個網站使用 hCaptcha 安全服務 (以下稱為 hCaptcha)。','We use the hCaptcha service to protect forms on our website from spam and automated bots. hCaptcha provides a verification mechanism to distinguish between human users and bots.'=>'這個網站使用提供辨別真人使用者及惡意漫遊器驗證機制的 hCaptcha 服務，藉以保護網站上的表單免於垃圾訊息及自動化惡意漫遊器侵擾。','Invisible Size'=>'隱形模式尺寸','Upgrade to Pro'=>'升級至 Pro 方案','%1$s and use %2$s. The hCaptcha widget will not appear, and the Challenge popup will be shown only to bots.'=>'%1$s便能使用%2$s。在這種情況下，不會顯示 hCaptcha 小工具，並僅會針對漫遊器顯示彈出式視窗。','Friction-free “No CAPTCHA” & 99.9% passive modes'=>'無干擾 (無人機驗證) 及 99.9% 被動模式','Selected items have been successfully deleted.'=>'選取的項目已成功刪除。','Replace Really Simple CAPTCH